 0 for five workshops plus one event if the City's budget is cut.\nApplicat
 ion fee not stated\n\nEligibility: Individual artists (or teams under one 
 lead) residing in Los Angeles County with a largely self-directed communit
 y practice.\n\nDeadline: 2026-10-30. 11:59 pm Pacific\n\nNotification May
 –June 2027. The companion CO-UP track is for social-justice nonprofits n
 aming a teaching artist.\n\nOfficial call: https://culture.lacity.gov/gran
 ts/near-co-op\nChecked 2026-10-19
