UID:epic-ai-megajam-2026@papers.aesthetic.computer
DTSTAMP:20261106T000000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261106T000000Z
DTSTART:20261116T015900Z
SUMMARY:Epic Games — 2026 Epic AI MegaJam — deadline
DESCRIPTION:Build a playable game in Unreal Engine or UEFN in four days. AI
  tools are optional\; solo entrants and teams of up to five people can com
 pete.\n\nMain awards: Best Overall Unreal Engine\, Best Overall UEFN\, and
  Best Student Project (either engine)\, each with $7\,500 / $5\,000 / $2\,
 500 for first / second / third. Modifiers: Best Team (2–5 people)\, $5\,
 000\; Solo Driver\, $2\,500\; Render Royalty (visuals)\, $2\,500\; Pocket 
 Powerhouse (mobile)\, $2\,500 per engine\; Glass Box (dev log)\, $2\,500\;
  Walkie-Talkie (narrative UEFN game with LLM-powered NPCs)\, $2\,500. Sepa
 rate continuation grants: $50\,000 / $25\,000 / $10\,000 in each engine ca
 tegory. Prizes are competitive\; no guaranteed participant payment.\nEntry
  fee not stated\n\nEligibility: Developers age 18+ with an active Epic Gam
 es account\, solo or in teams of up to five. Online participation from any
 where\; full eligibility restrictions apply under the Official Rules. The 
 student category requires current enrollment in higher education.\n\nDeadl
 ine: 2026-11-15. 5:59 PM PST / 8:59 PM EST\; late submissions disqualified
 \n\nDo not start building the game before November 12. Tools\, agents and 
 MCP may be set up beforehand\; declare earlier prompts\, scripts and asset
 s. Choose Unreal Engine or UEFN\, not both. Entrants retain ownership\; co
 nsult the linked Official Rules.\n\nOfficial call: https://itch.io/jam/202
 6-epic-ai-megajam\nChecked 2026-11-06
URL:https://itch.io/jam/2026-epic-ai-megajam
LOCATION:Online · optional San Francisco event
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
